SUMMARY:Cultivating Family Harmony—A Spiritual Chat for 18-40 yo
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Does life feel m
 ore gratifying when you live it with joy and harmony?**\n\n**Are you curio
 us how to maintain harmony with others in your everyday life?**\n\n**Would
  you like to experience a deeper sense of inner peace?**\n\n“. . . [I]f 
 you’re having a problem with your loved one or someone not so loved—in
 stead of saying\, ‘God\, help me be stronger\,’ maybe just try ‘Thy 
 will be done.’\n“It's unconditional love that makes such a prayer.”\
 n—Harold Klemp\, *ECK Wisdom on Prayer\,*\n*Meditation\, and Contemplati
 on\,* p. 17\n\nYou’re warmly invited to this casual and upbeat chat with
  other young spiritual seekers who want to learn more about the ways of th
 e Divine. Come and share your stories or listen to others' stories of how 
 Spirit works uniquely with each of us.\n\n***Explore*** . . .\n\n* How to 
 better understand your relationships\n* Ways to increase your capacity to 
 give grace to loved ones\n* The sacred chant\, HU\, and how it can change 
 your vibration and shift your perspective\n* Learn about a Spiritual Exerc
 ise that can help you open your awareness to new viewpoints and attitudes.
 \n\nDrop in when it works for you and cameras are always optional.\nLookin
 g forward to meeting you!\n\n**Welcome to Eckankar**\nThe teachings of ECK
 ANKAR are based on God’s love and spiritual freedom for everyone.\n\nThe
 y offer you individual spiritual tools\, whatever your path or religion ma
 y be\, to bring you more understanding\, love\, and help in these challeng
 ing times.\n\nCome\, stay as long as you like\, and explore spiritual reso
 urces that can help you\, at your own pace. Feel free to come and to go as
  you wish.\nThere is no pressure\, expectation\, judgment\, or unasked-for
  follow up.\n**We respect your divinity as a spiritual being.**\n\n**We ho
 nor your choices and your journey.**
